{"seq":2,"slug":"recover-incentive","title":"挽回激励（券/包邮）与频控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/abandoned-recovery/recover-incentive","wordCount":3050,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"挽回激励-券-包邮-与频控\">挽回激励（券/包邮）与频控</h1><p>上一章确定了「救谁、什么时候、从哪里救」。这一篇回答最后一个问题：<strong>要不要给钱。</strong> 给券是支付失败挽回里最有效的杠杆之一，也是最容易亏钱的杠杆之一——因为它的效果与风险不对称：给对了，一笔原本可能永久流失的订单被救回，补贴成本远低于获取一个新客；给错了，平台为一批本来就会成交的订单付了钱，甚至还教出了一批专门靠「故意失败」薅券的用户。</p>\n<p>这篇文档交付激励的决策模型与频控机制。它消费上篇的召回候选集与触达轮次（激励通常从第二轮开始出现），消费 <a href=\"failure-rate-optimize\">支付成功率分析与优化</a> 的净增归因方法来衡量真实收益，并依赖 <a href=\"../failure-classification/decline-reason-normalize\">各渠道拒绝码归一化</a> 的失败分类来决定哪些失败值得配激励。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-激励只在三个条件同时成立时才划算\">核心概念：激励只在三个条件同时成立时才划算</h2><p>补贴一笔订单的决策，本质是一次投入产出的比较。设一笔待召回订单的应付金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，商品毛利率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，激励成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（券面额或包邮的运费成本），召回触达带来的成功概率提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，则补贴的期望增量收益为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>touch</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R = \\Delta q \\cdot \\left(g \\cdot A - s\\right) - c\\_{\\text{touch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">touch</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>touch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{touch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">touch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是触达成本（短信费等）。这个式子的关键项是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>只有被激励改变决策的那部分买家贡献了增量</strong>。已经打算回来付款的买家无论如何都会成功，给他券是纯损失；原本绝不会成功（例如卡已过期且没有别的工具）的买家给了券也不会成功。因此激励只在三个条件同时成立时划算：</p>\n<p><strong>条件一：失败原因不是工具无效。</strong> 卡已过期、卡号不存在这类终态失败，券救不了——问题不在价格而在支付工具。给这类买家发券是错误的资源投放，正确动作是引导换卡（见 <a href=\"../alternative-payment/alternative-method-suggest\">推荐可用本地支付方式</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>条件二：买家的流失是可被价格影响的。</strong> 众所周知，某些失败原因下的流失高度价格敏感（例如比价过程中放弃），而另一些与价格无关（例如暂时无法完成支付、网络问题）。前者配券有效，后者配券基本无效。</p>\n<p><strong>条件三：边际毛利为正。</strong> 也就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g \\cdot A &gt; s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>。若激励成本超过毛利，这笔单救回来也是亏的。这条看似显然，但在实践中常被忽略：满减券的面额往往与订单金额脱钩，一张固定面额的券在小额订单上很容易突破这个边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类型</th>\n<th>是否配激励</th>\n<th>主要激励形态</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>余额不足 / 超限</td>\n<td>是（谨慎）</td>\n<td>小额券或免运费</td>\n<td>价格敏感，但补贴可能被习惯化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控拒绝（可换方式）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>免运费为主</td>\n<td>需促使其换工具而非降价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证中断</td>\n<td>否（一般）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>未完成而非放弃，提醒即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道故障</td>\n<td>是（补偿性）</td>\n<td>免运费或小额券</td>\n<td>平台责任，补偿性质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡过期/工具无效</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无（引导换卡）</td>\n<td>激励无法解决工具问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品不可售等前提破损</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>放弃召回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[召回第二轮待触达] --&gt; B{失败类型可配激励?}&#10;    B --&gt;|工具无效/前提破损| C[不配激励&lt;br/&gt;仅提醒或引导换方式]&#10;    B --&gt;|可配| D[计算边际毛利 g*A &gt; s ?]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[降级为免运费或纯提醒]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{频控是否放行?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[纯提醒, 不带激励]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[选择激励形态与面额]&#10;    H --&gt; I[写入券实例, 绑定订单与有效期]&#10;    I --&gt; J[触达并记录券的发放]&#10;    J --&gt; K[观测使用与支付结果]&#10;    K --&gt; L[估算净增与补贴 ROI]&#10;    L --&gt; M[回写激励策略参数]\">graph TD\n    A[召回第二轮待触达] --&gt; B{失败类型可配激励?}\n    B --&gt;|工具无效/前提破损| C[不配激励&lt;br/&gt;仅提醒或引导换方式]\n    B --&gt;|可配| D[计算边际毛利 g*A &gt; s ?]\n    D --&gt;|否| E[降级为免运费或纯提醒]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{频控是否放行?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[纯提醒, 不带激励]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[选择激励形态与面额]\n    H --&gt; I[写入券实例, 绑定订单与有效期]\n    I --&gt; J[触达并记录券的发放]\n    J --&gt; K[观测使用与支付结果]\n    K --&gt; L[估算净增与补贴 ROI]\n    L --&gt; M[回写激励策略参数]</pre><h2 id=\"激励形态的选择\">激励形态的选择</h2><p>券不是唯一形态，不同形态的成本结构与适用场景不同。</p>\n<p><strong>免运费</strong>通常是跨境场景里性价比最高的激励。它的成本明确（实际的运费差额）、金额适中、心理价值高（跨境运费本身是买家明显的痛感），而且不易被习惯化成「每次都该有」。它对风控拒绝类失败尤其合适——让买家愿意多花一步换支付工具。</p>\n<p><strong>小额无门槛券</strong>的转化力最强，但风险也最大：它最容易被习惯化（买家学会「怀疑要发券就先让支付失败」），且在低客单商品上容易突破毛利边界。</p>\n<p>**定向券（限品类/限商品）**能在保住转化力的同时限制被薅的空间，因为它的使用范围受限，对本来就要买该品类的买家价值低，因而习惯化的收益小。</p>\n<p><strong>包税或关税补贴</strong>在跨境场景里是一种特殊形态，效果有时很显著（买家对「到手价不确定」的焦虑是跨境特有的流失原因），但成本核算复杂，通常只对高价值订单使用。</p>\n<p><strong>延长价格保护期</strong>是一种零成本形态：承诺在若干时间内价格不变，让买家不必担心「过两天再看」会涨价。它不产生直接成本，只在价格确实上涨时才有成本，而它恰恰针对「比价犹豫」这类价格敏感的流失。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>成本确定性</th>\n<th>习惯化风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免运费</td>\n<td>高（成本可精算）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>跨境通用，风控拒绝类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小额无门槛券</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低客单、价格敏感类流失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向券</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>品类明确的订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包税/关税补贴</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高价值跨境订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格保护</td>\n<td>低（条件性成本）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>比价犹豫类流失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>形态选择应与失败原因对齐</strong>，这是本文与前几章最直接的耦合点：风控拒绝类的痛点是「我的卡不能用」，此时给免运费或小额券能提供额外的动力去换一张卡；余额不足类的痛点是「现在钱不够」，此时给券的意义有限（买家缺的是余额而非优惠），更有效的可能是拉长召回窗口而非加码补贴。把「什么失败配什么激励」写进配置表，比全局一套激励规则更省钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频控-三层限流\">频控：三层限流</h2><p>激励一旦被用户学会预期，就会从「挽回工具」退化成「价格补贴」。频控是防止这件事发生的机制，它需要在三个层面同时生效，缺一层都会留下被薅的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：单用户单位时间的激励次数上限。</strong> 无论失败多少单，一个买家在一个时间窗内能拿到的激励次数有硬上限。这一层防的是「批量下多单，逐个制造失败，逐个领券」。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：单用户同一订单的激励不可叠加。</strong> 同一笔待支付订单在一次召回周期内只能被配一次激励，且不可与其它活动券叠加使用。这一层防的是「反复失败反复加码」——如果每失败一次就多给一点，理性的买家会持续失败。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：行为模式检测。</strong> 前两层是静态规则，第三层针对的是绕过静态规则的组合行为：短时间内高频创建订单并取消支付、多账号在同一设备或同一收货地址上领券、以及「失败—领券—成功—退款」这类完整薅羊毛链路。这层的判据通常是行为特征而非单点规则，且必须<strong>允许申诉</strong>，因为正常买家也可能因为网络问题产生类似特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>控制对象</th>\n<th>典型阈值维度</th>\n<th>绕过路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>次数上限</td>\n<td>单用户激励频次</td>\n<td>时间窗内次数</td>\n<td>多账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可叠加</td>\n<td>单订单激励次数</td>\n<td>订单 × 召回周期</td>\n<td>反复失败加码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为检测</td>\n<td>组合行为模式</td>\n<td>设备/地址/支付工具</td>\n<td>需申诉兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要注意第三层的一个副作用：<strong>过度激进的频控会把真正需要挽回的买家误拦</strong>，尤其是那些因为真实网络或资金问题多次尝试的买家。因此设计上应当把「拦截」与「降级」区分开——命中行为特征时通常只是<strong>不给激励</strong>（降级为纯提醒），而不是把召回整体取消。这样既堵住了薅羊毛，又不损失基础的提醒触达。</p>\n<p><strong>激励的时效与不可转移。</strong> 券必须绑定具体订单与买家，有明确的短有效期（通常以小时到天计），并且不可转让。绑定订单是为了让券无法被囤积用于其它购买，短有效期是为了让券的使用与本次召回紧密关联，避免变成一种通用折扣。这几个约束看似琐碎，但它们共同决定了券是否真的只对本笔挽回生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本核算与真实-roi\">成本核算与真实 ROI</h2><p>激励的 ROI 必须用净增而非总量来计算，否则会把本来就会成交的订单算作激励的功劳。设被触达组与未触达组的支付成功率分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则净增成功率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q = q_T - q_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，激励的真实 ROI 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>激</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>无激</mtext></mrow><mtext>平均激励成本</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{\\Delta q*{\\text{激}} - \\Delta q*{\\text{无激}}}{\\text{平均激励成本}} \\times g \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均激励成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">激</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无激</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母是平均激励成本，分子是「配激励相对不配激励的额外净增成功率」。注意这里的比较有两层：既要有触达与不触达的对照（衡量催化的价值），也要有带激励与不带激励的对照（衡量补贴的额外价值）。只做后者会高估激励的作用，只做前者会低估召回整体的价值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对照设计</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>组数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触达+激励 vs 不触达</td>\n<td>召回链路整体价值</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触达+激励 vs 触达无激励</td>\n<td>补贴的边际价值</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不同激励形态对比</td>\n<td>形态选择</td>\n<td>按形态数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不同面额对比</td>\n<td>面额有效性曲线</td>\n<td>按档位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三、四行的实验需要足够样本量才能得出结论，而支付失败事件的绝对量通常不如正常流量大，因此这类实验往往需要较长的运行期。实践中更可行的做法是<strong>先做形态与面额的粗粒度 A/B</strong>（例如免运费 vs 小额券），把细粒度调优放在对一个稳定结论的持续微调上，而不是每档面额都单独实验。</p>\n<p>一个必须监控的负向指标是<strong>激励依赖度</strong>：如果把激励去掉后成功率显著下探，说明买家已经把激励纳入了预期。这是策略需要收紧的信号，处理方式是静默降低面额或延长频控窗口，而不是突然取消（突然取消会让一批买家感到被欺骗）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>激励只在三个条件同时成立时才划算：失败原因不是工具无效、买家流失可被价格影响、且边际毛利为正（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g \\cdot A &gt; s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>）；卡过期等终态失败配券是浪费。</li>\n<li>期望增量收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>touch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R = \\Delta q (gA - s) - c_{\\text{touch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">touch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 只包含被激励改变决策的部分，给本来就会付款的买家发券是纯损失。</li>\n<li>激励形态要与失败原因对齐：风控拒绝类宜免运费或小额券以促使换工具，余额不足类加码补贴意义有限，延长召回窗口可能更有效；跨境场景中免运费与价格保护性价比较高。</li>\n<li>频控需要三层同时生效：单用户次数上限、单订单不可叠加、行为模式检测；命中行为特征时应降级为「不给激励」而非取消召回，避免误伤真实多次尝试的买家。</li>\n<li>券必须绑定订单与买家、短有效期、不可转让，这些约束共同保证券只对本笔挽回生效而不退化成通用折扣。</li>\n<li>ROI 必须用净增计算，并同时做「触达 vs 不触达」与「带激励 vs 不带激励」两层对照；需持续监控激励依赖度，收紧时静默降面额而非突然取消。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"挽回激励（券/包邮）与频控","id":"挽回激励-券-包邮-与频控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：激励只在三个条件同时成立时才划算","id":"核心概念-激励只在三个条件同时成立时才划算"},{"level":2,"text":"激励形态的选择","id":"激励形态的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"频控：三层限流","id":"频控-三层限流"},{"level":2,"text":"成本核算与真实 ROI","id":"成本核算与真实-roi"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"待支付订单挽回触达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/abandoned-recovery/pending-payment-recover"},"next":{"title":"支付成功率分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/abandoned-recovery/failure-rate-optimize"}}